{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1316,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1d12ec485ba32c37ef8261f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天的夜晚比较长，\r\n感觉这件衣服也很适合\r\n穿去参加晚上的婚礼呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ad2e260e021e94f6131b73a83d03855fc525bef2d45dc2c91944697f200a798",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:140fccba41c32a153f8d055a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一～点都不觉得冷喔♪\r\n因为这件衣服包含了机伶\r\n火热又可爱的「认真」心情♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3afaab2890c19b57bf6411fcafbb97d58c7569da4f8b2817630c0f5d2791b86f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fe355710bf672550ad91fe0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "等机伶长大后，哥哥还愿意\r\n用一样的眼光看待机伶吗？\r\n……呵呵♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2413d192f9a31eb70a3161e96d3e0cc994df4fae15a135ed8cf3aebe1f30c60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1497b23c24e5e4868c40616",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "机伶穿这件衣服时有多「认真」，\r\n哥哥应该看得出来吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f18d78dc3b243881afd6a8c9b5572ff29c738be5e7713e487845b559fbc2ed22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a71b629316903da01de3e71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要不要把Umasta的头像换掉呢？\r\n姐姐所拍的机伶很可爱嘛。\r\n这就是爱吗♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3012885ca2bdb5bff93d38961ea3b552b363f3085daae97ce0f58b2bdde661d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed1b49ad81449317aaa8814b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有关注者把机伶比喻为樱花啊。\r\n姐姐很清楚，我并没有\r\n那么虚无缥缈对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6867a6ab8e9510dd6ff0ab8d852fe32bb4b45465927061a54937ece557e963d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91112"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b11092138f814d6836a0cb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是谁，都无法盖过\r\n机伶的可爱♪所以……\r\n姐姐要试试看把我染上你的颜色吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e45a795e5a7967281ca19219c96f46efc78ff3a9664e355ab2a07bbe0c716bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91116"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b9ddd9e13e76938440b37ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然舍不得放弃早上去叫姐姐\r\n起床的机会～\r\n但让你叫我起床也不错呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b0f89e9579a33df1437efb908df48eccd70d444cd0d1fe9c7ef4bd7d46149f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a349fc48f6d48328314261ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这身衣服的颜色很容易融进夜晚里，\r\n但姐姐应该找得到机伶吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88a9813e7c77b4ff56454ef4a3026ab37a884459edc925401ff01c9be8e3a438",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91123"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6286f32ff6f3614ebd24f85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然赏花也不错～\r\n但希望姐姐一直觉得\r\n「机伶比花更漂亮」呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "10a5f1e8319c7b7f4814005c274cfb7f246278e413d3e1228fa5dea6338f2a05",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91124"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea14ffc6bf22f3acd7565e4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "等机伶长大后，姐姐还愿意\r\n用一样的眼光看待机伶吗？\r\n……呵呵♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "13ebea1785373f6f07ad879cb0dda881a3fd00dc1c4c70cb6aebbccdacdc6232",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91128"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0ceb60c2acea29703a4671a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "机伶穿这件衣服时有多「认真」，\r\n姐姐应该看得出来吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ab7fa4dec8b6ec27bb342b28dccb44a3056c7b9a0edb5d4a7cbcf4bf3f91010",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91129"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eacb05f88227b0b2761a7593",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "假如机伶非常努力，\r\n哥哥会更喜欢我吗？\r\n那我就多加把劲好了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a69a67948e0b301290559f8e6fa76583ab33bf047d918c4f8ccadf371fad958e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1efb930c1f9be16632badbaa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "がんばるぞー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "24015781d11c52373aa86bcad5f8914e6d6753feb7978a8668df21d93ac6cd17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a2314b5f94f93ca8daff9ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练需要消耗脑力、体力和心力，\r\n还挺辛苦的……\r\n所以才有展现可爱的价值！",
      "source_fingerprint": "286f13b0a431f8a318ea02535f8b13f0e6ca6c05f62e2a2bbf03695f9e7cbd4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c87c06ccbf8819afac413c2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥哥偶尔也来一起训练吧？\r\n机伶会温柔地教导你的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfd74e5a3d9604cb4db731fd0b18a315044022e27addb5c491cf1c66e7b323f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42d13509af4ea78dfb1b8e86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，对了！进行约会特训怎么样？\r\n我们就外出到各地玩耍，\r\n然后……咦，不行吗♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "95f7a6433567b89a9c948bf32e5395a119b4bee946e61ce2c5c1f7099ed93167",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa78d25f2df1075a9fa2829b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛～苦训练跟机伶的个性不合……\r\n不过卖力挑战的模样或许会很受欢迎？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6024cd3c022121abc8267ce68e2be12363cd004bc13560a96102d4baa9c7496f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:475f4da6980dfcb8f60781b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让机伶见识一下\r\n哥哥专业的地方吧？\r\n希望你做得帅气一点♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab172f81b0e14a210f53956de5ddbc47aa4488d51d0e864132001797fa242625",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc08b34b500870d80d992a7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "机伶希望透过哥哥的眼光，\r\n来评估我怎样才能变得更可爱。\r\n拜托你告诉我，我现在还缺少什么！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c99167eda9c5316acc89b7822d1553f52f8a111f1951d613d67159ca3637551",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4182de85f44a7f1c2e350037",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "之后再给我看确认姿势的影片哦～♪\r\n如果有不错的镜头，\r\n我想上传到Umasta去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9211449a3507d94322e2d3c46f8f9f5cc6ca2cc9a81011553c4417477a5fff50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64abd69ffada4e31183bb76a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是生病的时候～\r\n还是健康的时候～\r\n都要麻烦你照顾机伶喔～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b31edea18b63cb50d66f1a9b72d86f46f53c10ebe1a9ceabe60c5920c460347",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:434ba1d7ece3674c7c0edf3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "等严格的训练结束后，\r\n希望你能弥补我，让我尽情撒娇呢～\r\n……开玩笑的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9778652b95e723c164c06a339a7bb1b4e56be334903a447745ed39e18222672",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0e6ac82294d04b43bdafc78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "机伶觉得自己很～清楚\r\n哪些是应该要做的事情。\r\n因为可爱需要一点一滴地累积♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "39c471384cbfbe0a6193929c16e13c50ae7730a566cfb0206a352df219bb780f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bf9e65cf9543045b945bc97",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然机伶训练时，\r\n你可以看到入迷～\r\n但还是不能太心不在焉喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc5afc319fd0e1a77ce06386a2825bcc4a104b25be52dcc0dbef165d3abfc2e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7beae9a3ba7dc5bb5af58b08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥哥或许会害\r\n机伶的可爱失控喔？\r\n所以～你要负起责任照顾我♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "44f87b5c56d816afd128d01dd2d5ae0558dabea1ede6761b15333643b82d614a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7e4058855e2f65c8e718f98",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "机伶相信哥哥。\r\n所以哥哥也要相信机伶……\r\n引导机伶喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "11105b2fde71e943d9079ab555778b998fa1dfc44e1711850d61225b73ba30b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07ec2f104874ab12cb1c04f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要和哥哥在一起，\r\n机伶的命运和可爱，\r\n一定会变得更～美好♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "03b75e34460dac007d97a480a52637f8883f4999d2b617294e6e3b012d2aae6c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f79b96bc67a8ee7fd32b0381",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "假如机伶非常努力，\r\n姐姐会更喜欢我吗？\r\n那我就多加把劲好了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fed252ef7ac25911be5a45f53bfa44c6ebd1b24ae28e2e25d7a62f2cc9c2d05b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "92100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96d4067f85bf1a97db0555ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐偶尔也来一起训练吧？\r\n机伶会温柔地教导你的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac7ad248d810eadfd87ad088ec2943933d3b447cab2678ddee206369db76b5a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "92102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d24d892ffcd7ee4710830925",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让机伶见识一下\r\n姐姐专业的地方吧？\r\n希望你做得帅气一点♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "457688b0193ab9dab4d44c753a9a3dca53adb1d6ce75d3c4e15768910aa4e9fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "92106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94b6b8d15420ff3e64fce885",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "机伶希望透过姐姐的眼光，\r\n来评估我怎样才能变得更可爱。\r\n拜托你告诉我，我现在还缺少什么！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fc205b58a653ffacf6c195dd0778e0c2e125732d7d06bf0d895f621af83db20",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "92107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cbd228ef8648c605e1d77c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐或许会害\r\n机伶的可爱失控喔？\r\n所以～你要负起责任照顾我♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "eae5539c934c8ab5f22923e2540d03911fe98af6fcede82bf8c77bc7df1c9994",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "92120"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4e8d18d0b1f1929cfa28f40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "机伶相信姐姐。\r\n所以姐姐也要相信机伶……\r\n引导机伶喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "82864fce5070f58d5c1340f2267943f1da30cd825dd7991d464c572c464b531c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "92121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9bb96feb7718ef1fef2611d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要和姐姐在一起，\r\n机伶的命运和可爱，\r\n一定会变得更～美好♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e079d4f86495eceb676185656d116650408520eb283fcab5693e631b3e0b7c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "92122"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9861ddf87c79984a0c2aa5c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在的机伶是宇宙第一可爱对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "528e13dcee2eb54d442ce3407656a99c4681ccce39a35f69623ffebb84a8ac32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bbfbd56de387fb50c8340f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "机伶超乖的哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f81ec9c844c9390b21628ebbd6d1569a5a6bd1d355fc041292e99a498e94b6dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2a94c0d2fc71f7e565de1d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你要发誓，以后也要永～远\r\n和机伶在一起喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f43ed597506b52fd72eac887f1ad95d0bf8af970e0410ae1dc77c792ac85cd6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:814e1b8251b9c77c6cdfab76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是我们的崭新旅程呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b008c309c41e263a5991fca0f1226af18148cd837a23a862b189648040933c9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5b5b7d8c30af9b92eae985c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "根据订阅人数的不同，感谢礼物也会越来越丰厚哦♪\n可以请你帮忙宣传一下频道吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "606d870572d40b939fec6686157c7952c60332894a50c90695a7bb1677fd25a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "940000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f5b20fc94610b9a68ad9251",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "机伶有顺利长大吧～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d573e638cff12cdfbe13d93e8baa37bbf546c3863f766a61c0c9f7f5f08f3129",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb954edfd4d58bd41586d235",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我变得更可爱了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce5f9c541fc6bc190cb1e68fe0ad36cc6f505683e57fb43b2d383ab39e506463",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9723506069d4afbad75fb343",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好的，我是真机伶♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "76fe61958082fa09e4233073bd7a064db7fd774088304038c7ac7382de2a033e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c66e869027c32ef5e410f684",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿♪\r\n要多多疼爱我哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "530bd386ebe36aeba3119d26170c94fc4768fdc0dfb29d89c72cc04723946ab9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a5bfa5d2979eab052a9de39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要帮忙请交给我♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e0b3ecb6af5a51fb2ec192f219900f2162d2c8d6bc68e83ea13097b8c31c2d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11f9c97a47bcc7789d613471",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "交给机伶帮忙♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "93acb6659a11a041ee83a18e7cf0dcdad8780739156c92c18af72fcb5ff9f2fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a51e522da0679a17fcd55a18",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是可爱修行的成果♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4baa6ed58865d7d5daf18d4c97c1d9fc08c6d3399e1eebbead9d66476a9043df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bab7435483bcb5ea5f15bca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "机伶，\r\n变得更～加成熟了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fec6643767831c76513f1517028e5202fee0d40e7a3bab32fd782c93a14e0bc2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc9771d23c75b55c1736c837",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会让你感、觉、到♪\r\n你的命运和机伶连在一起……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed9fd248329b5de7acde7d05859d71c4499e0d5060d4d186845c890852a53544",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49e92c82645eb5b4632a4f11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是真机伶。\r\n以后只能看着我喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fbca07e24cff972cffa8a97fba454868cbeac40d0632bd101785eefb45246aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbfddcb0af3567be32180ff6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是不会输的～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fe04caae268b3cf481f758bd1f7e06ef363e3b6bea14f1078530934b3b35d9a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b3e853adce8d11819b343ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和你一起朝公主之路前进，\r\n我一定会成为\r\n「理想的自己」～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ba88563ce5b674952fc56f36fbaa384d9ac68bded2391686bf263dd4e2c2f18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cf2c71802c1bcb6248937ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってきますわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "317dc62707757e1a6cbef02121d574f0379699dc1ece45cd2512b71b71853c46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4366096d462f494db8da4fa6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま戻りましてよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "10e4acb9ecd92e8c02e087f0b1d0a97bbeb1d3d3259716ae908d21d5989da518",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8db415dc33d54d204d94a48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「公主」与「传说中的训练员」……\r\n总觉得我们两个\r\n最近越来越接近目标了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8de72f1e220b4f086f494504348780cc9bc4d7076e9d29dfd0c45cebd7517bfb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c59daaaa00d706391a91914",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是怎样的战斗，只要我们有\r\n「情谊」之力就是无敌的！对吧？\r\n王子【训练员】？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c5db7a6d7badc7504afa791514706a9ff44a0864a0133880e802657e382cadb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d76b38ddbaddcd935f0b7084",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有在老家捣麻糬！\r\n喊着嘿咻、嘿咻，\r\n超强意志力～～～～～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9761eae21c637cdd749750c4f90f03e97b37b4675b55bf1ef8d764bf6e9bae0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f394e938176d836f229d6fc1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身为一个公主，有买了\r\n感谢巧克力给照顾我的人！\r\n当然你也有喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "cafa86e016b6f189687ee19a702a4fbe9926f9a0f77cd9c360c00a1316b10c00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6d3ea4e191908051a4ffcd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！！\r\n真情大爆发的公主巧克力，\r\n让你的心也大爆炸喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ef2a0393b72d0415545e64410f59a086145e44bb07d19675a21bea887379d36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e68cf182bdecdf082c57bb5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我和王子就像织女和牛郎……\r\n如果是我根本等不了一年，\r\n会直接游过银河去见他！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac93ec863f424438eb43460382904cad56fb4c8162f41f0ff9039053ceab285e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be98b27950e51bec37b07840",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不给王子就捣蛋♪\r\n不交出王子的话，\r\n我就要大闹一番喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b181f562a40b0b99c128893a0f10bfc18fde60c673feffd7bdb1e3b7645de78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3aee952c2031d935519690d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞节……\r\n我小时候曾经一把抓住了\r\n假扮圣诞老人的父亲呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a34e5d7862be97e91a1c465ba58eacf20c1a422e30ce68b5c24eacc6ffeb4092",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8c7daec047717e260689673",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今晚要不要去车站前面走走？\r\n在灯饰中漫步的公主和王子……\r\n就像公主战士第43话那样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "72126362c9f0db10215eff8ccc6cef075b2cf257d38f035fb4a760bb6094d591",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b0f9145aa5b990f0436fc3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是当然的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6410b6230376517afb941139a73d618e241553f10b64bcbd7027264e1b53b070",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f6533df305ebafaeeb80721",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到了要大扫除的时候呢！\r\n把尘埃和灰尘\r\n一起彻底清除掉吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0caf22eb3901b7fa86ce13a974ce416e53eaecb289ffe42c7b960052764222d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68bc6071746dafc2a5c67f6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日就由公主\r\n我、本、人♪\r\n亲手好好～地帮你揉肩膀庆生！",
      "source_fingerprint": "60be408499a976a7b0695b4fa741ab7cc904fb8e768a7537876c9675e6898c88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9505897c2b25fe53fae48e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天是亲爱的训练员的生日……\r\n由本公主亲自为你带来\r\n无法忘怀的一天♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2495f68664f716c1c57017f0138077e459da87bb9c8cb339c71fcbdfd309ccf0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df50be0f3939c3d428b2b551",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "公主生日快乐♪\r\n现正举办公主的庆生会喔！\r\n一起飞奔过去吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dca34d7b3bf18d2c2d334ddb7e0326739dd9c318c747e69e53841995b20ba60c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d043e2dc7242bd59a647adf1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可以用「我的公主」\r\n称呼我当作生日礼物吗？\r\n快点快点，要像王子一样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c6b87b864d5f0c9ec96eae1f32112baa0d579ccf9dd1d97ee3ff5292b3b77f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99b2a1fbf7b122c968055c43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有新的公告喔！\r\n会是派对的邀请函吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "aefd10eda6f1f3358214f91161b98da0f53abf90dd0036c822aafa79a5622f5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b97de45878f4aacb5cf442ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到礼物了呢！\r\n会不会是送给公主的赠品……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b275beba9852fa02119256bf0152ce103c28c14fce11e2e87ea83876584e5c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7ddce8b82d85beafe638b98",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "达成任务了～！\r\n不知道能收到怎样的奖赏，\r\n兴奋又期待☆心跳得好快呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d26046f1abf71768807b42f9a5961b5ef22b461025c226ccce303309f44ae849",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63dc854f4687cdcf39c5de40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动好像就快开始了！\r\n要是能有什么公主要素的话，\r\n我就会瞬间充满活力喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4a828efae594f0ee9096bda2b2b9e124fb1eefb912388f596ffd07bda1f3f58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2466a22d2b2a579f8e65c13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让人很感兴趣的活动呢！\r\n这种兴致高昂的气氛……\r\n我也热血沸腾了～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cef5abd836c1746e604e647217ddd94ccc2d09960d51e64b044545f25a63642a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ada19abb0d93372b128f6c24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么会这样──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "03151c25f35fc3630f57ab973751b51857a5c18da9fbcef3f62f86a56586c0f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee046325c4db3f35afb2cd1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名册的等级\r\n热烈提升咯！是努力\r\n和意志力的成果呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebe24ff791c939a8917a3a1f88b294f539070ae138e537d81a83972fa45b9b8c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9beeb3a98a795cd689ad3327",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勝負の時はレースだけでは\r\nありませんのよ！姫たるもの、\r\n常に麗しく気高く屈強に！ですわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b7b4229636ec4845da1f2a9857eb9e93ed0c449ad56188a6f687e4fe8237363",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28cb259dc2946c4ad8576359",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姫たるもの休日も気品あふれる\r\n格好でなくては！24時間365日\r\nエレガントに休みはないのですわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9eb29fff5d4e5bcdf7c70fe50d6418d135e159f6c007ea7fb1addb1dd1cf057f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd46c39836b29094494de5b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "靴を片方なくすと、王子様が届けに\r\n来るというお話がありますわね…\r\n靴飛ばしなら自信がありますわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ab8faaff025aab4f38a1293073662f26c80d60faacd5e1c8edf1d7a2d642838",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae44ffdf504005c91d65014f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "挺厉害的嘛……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f79a65b5400123870007376bfc0346d5bbd1bb2edc05b27cc5175f3196d94c7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "1003"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
